  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-千川PC全域投放\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\"],\"capability_summary\":\"获取全域可排除的抖音视频或图文列表，适用于千川客户根据营销目标、抖音号等条件筛选素材的场景。关键配合接口有【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.uni_promotion_block_material.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/block_material/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1825215820766292\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1825215820766292\",\"title\":\"获取全域可排除抖音视频/图文列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mCjGmfFQ\">获取投放计划可排除抖音视频/图文列表</p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1823381381386250%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1748264006369288%2C%22id%22%3A%22U2z7u%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-VqnEOOMY\" id=\"h346b9f0-VqnEOOMY\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-C2ViRS9R\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/block_material/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/block_material/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1825215820766292\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-NpWKGD4r\" id=\"h346b9f0-NpWKGD4r\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-ldahih2f\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-JRi6AEAr\" id=\"h346b9f0-JRi6AEAr\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-hNDctfNY\" id=\"h346b9f0-hNDctfNY\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fe2oRvsA\">千川客户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2QfDdA15\">需拉取视频的抖音号</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">marketing_goal</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">营销目标</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">media_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 筛选素材类型，默认 视频，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-7N4f5lfh\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VhJS18NB\"><code>VIDEO</code> 视频</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jTSGPG6m\"><code>CAROUSEL</code> 图文</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">product_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vNmdaTvE\">商品ID，查询关联商品的相应视频，仅短视频带货场景需入参</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-6MFxAn3u\">注意：当marketing_goal=<code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code>时必填</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filtering</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FUvOmyYu\">过滤器</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">aweme_item_url</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Qjv1B7ux\">抖音主页视频url</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">analysis_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">素材分析类型，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-gKL2lJ3N\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XRYb7mmh\"><code>FIRST_PUBLISH_MATERIAL</code> 首发素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UcAHZcdk\"><code>HIGH_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 优质素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QJclnggW\"><code>LOW_QUALITY_MATERIAL</code> 低质素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QOXYqALL\"><code>INEFFICIENT_MATERIAL</code> 低效素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qmThJJEQ\"><code>CARRY_MATERIAL</code> 搬运素材</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dH561KRT\"><code>SIMILAR_MATERIAL</code> 同质化素材</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">排序字段，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-h0Z3ePkZ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cNlmZsT2\"><code>create_time</code> 按照创建时间从远到近</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9lPsgQqb\"><code>play_cnt</code> 按照播放量从低到高</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mC3ZuwwH\"><code>like_cnt</code> 按照点赞次数从低到高</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-OXPxBgdw\"><code>stat_cost</code> 按照消耗从低到高</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">cursor</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">页码游标值</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cqtj8CHr\" id=\"h346b9f0-cqtj8CHr\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv1.0%2Fqianchuan%2Funi_promotion%2Fblock_material%2Fget%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5C